+#### ECDSA Key (ES256)
+
+```json
+{
+  "keys": [
+    {
+      "kty": "EC",
+      "kid": "key-id-ec-001",
+      "use": "sig",
+      "alg": "ES256",
+      "crv": "P-256",
+      "x": "f83OJ3D2xF1Bg8vub9tLe1gHMzV76e8Tus9uPHvRVEU",
