+
+Add IdP-level claims to restrict which JWTs can use this Identity Provider.
+
+![Add claims](./img/fedidp-manual-7-add-claim.png)
+
+### Step 8: Click OK
+
+Click **OK** to create the Identity Provider.
+
+![Click OK](./img/fedidp-manual-8-click-ok.png)
+
